BioAvanceD ex-ante evaluation evidence package
Copyright (c) 2026 Denise Ribeiro — Universidade São Francisco (USF)

This deposit is a research evidence package (documentation, metrics, screenshots,
and the BioAvanceD Lab Population Pattern (BLPP) scripts included for
reproducibility of the evaluation). The BioAvanceD product repository remains
private (including software registration / INPI considerations) and is not
opened by this deposit.

## Documentation and evidence artefacts
Files under `docs/evidencias/` (markdown memos, checklists, UI screenshots, and
`ZENODO.md`) are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0).

You are free to share and adapt those materials provided you give appropriate
credit. Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

## Software snippets in this deposit (BLPP and compose overlay)
Source files under `api/backend/scripts/`, `api/backend/tests/unit/scripts/`,
`compose.lab-rs.yml`, and `infra/mongo/` are included solely so that the
evaluation method can be inspected and reproduced in a laboratory setting.

Copyright (c) 2026 Denise Ribeiro. All rights reserved for those software
files, except that recipients of this Zenodo deposit may use them for
non-commercial research reproducibility of the reported ex-ante evaluation.
Any other use (including redistribution as a product, incorporation into
commercial systems, or new software registration filings) requires prior
written permission from the copyright holder.

## Citation
Please cite this package using `CITATION.cff` and the Zenodo DOI assigned to
